<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Mod id="d9649087-8d65-4413-9bd6-56b6a458ead5" version="1">
  <Properties>
    <Name>More Right Click Shortcuts</Name>
    <Stability>Alpha</Stability>
    <Teaser>Context-aware right click shortcuts</Teaser>
    <Description>[ICON_BULLET] Right click on target city with caravan to change home city[NEWLINE]
[ICON_BULLET] RIght click on target city with great admiral to change home port[NEWLINE]
[ICON_BULLET] Right click on eligible airport city-surrounding tile to air rebase
[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]
Also adds 3 click modifier commands that affect all aircraft of the same type in the same airbase: 
[NEWLINE]
Massed Forward Rebase (Shift + Right Click on airbase):[NEWLINE]
[ICON_BULLET] Will move all aircraft on the selected hex to target airbase until no more slots are available or all aircraft have rebased[NEWLINE]
[ICON_BULLET] On each iteration, will move higher current hp aircraft first, with ties broken by unit level[NEWLINE]
[NEWLINE]
Massed Fallback Rebase (Alt + Right Click on airbase)[NEWLINE]
[ICON_BULLET] Will move all damaged aircraft on the selected hex to target airbase until no more slots are available or all aircraft have rebased[NEWLINE]
[ICON_BULLET] On each iteration, will move lower current hp aircraft first[NEWLINE]
[NEWLINE]
Massed Strike Mode (Shift + Right Click on enemy)[NEWLINE]
[ICON_BULLET] Will air strike the unit on the target hex using until all aircraft have attacked or the target is dead[NEWLINE]
[ICON_BULLET] On each iteration, will attack with higher current hp aircraft first, with ties broken by unit level[NEWLINE]
[ICON_BULLET] Aircraft that can attack more than once will do so before the next aircraft begins attacking[NEWLINE]</Description>
    <Authors>Vern</Authors>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
    <AffectsSavedGames>0</AffectsSavedGames>
    <SupportsSinglePlayer>1</SupportsSinglePlayer>
    <SupportsMultiplayer>0</SupportsMultiplayer>
    <SupportsHotSeat>1</SupportsHotSeat>
    <SupportsMac>1</SupportsMac>
    <ReloadAudioSystem>0</ReloadAudioSystem>
    <ReloadLandmarkSystem>0</ReloadLandmarkSystem>
    <ReloadStrategicViewSystem>0</ReloadStrategicViewSystem>
    <ReloadUnitSystem>0</ReloadUnitSystem>
  </Properties>
